---

<div class="services">
  <h2 class="sectiontitle">SERVICES</h2>
  <span class="what">WHAT WE DO</span>
  <p class="servicestext">
    Creative direction, concept development and full experience design. We
    structure proprietary events from strategy to execution, ensuring control
    over narrative, audience and environment. Each project is built as a system,
    not a production.
  </p>
  <div class="items">
    <div class="item">
      <img src="../../public/images/items1.png" alt="service" class="itemimg" />
      <h3 class="itemtitle">CORPORATE EVENTS</h3>
      <p class="itemtext">
        Conferences, launches, and conventions that inspire.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <img src="../../public/images/items2.png" alt="service" class="itemimg" />
      <h3 class="itemtitle">BRAND EXPERIENCES</h3>
      <p class="itemtext">
        Activations and experiences that connect and transform.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <img src="../../public/images/items3.png" alt="service" class="itemimg" />
      <h3 class="itemtitle">PRIVATE EVENTS</h3>
      <p class="itemtext">Unique celebrations tailored to your vision.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <img src="../../public/images/items4.png" alt="service" class="itemimg" />
      <h3 class="itemtitle">FULL PRODUCTION</h3>
      <p class="itemtext">
        Design, logistics, and execution with attention to every detail.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="item">
      <img src="../../public/images/items5.png" alt="service" class="itemimg" />
      <h3 class="itemtitle">STRATEGIC CONSULTING</h3>
      <p class="itemtext">Creative strategies for purpose-driven events.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .services {
    background-color: #0c0c09;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .servicestext {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    text-align: justify;
    width: 70vw;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .sectiontitle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: red;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .sectiontitle::after {
    content: "";
    width: 4rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .what {
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
    align-items: center;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    width: 18vw;
  }
  .itemimg {
    height: 4rem;
    width: 4rem;
  }
  /* .itemtitle {
    color: red;
  } */
  .itemtitle,
  .itemimg,
  .itemtext {
    margin: 1rem;
  }
  .itemtext {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .services {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .servicestext {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .items {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .item {
      width: 90%;
      border-right: none;
      border-left: none;
    }
  }
</style>
